0..48 Comment "// This source shows an importer through a flow."
49..51 Comment "//"
52..131 Comment "// A package moves on while its importers stay. A flow presents a newer package"
132..210 Comment "// at an older signature. This source also defines a flow that adds scaling. A"
211..277 Comment "// renaming presents the newer package at the older signature too."
278..280 Comment "//"
281..356 Comment "// The checker reads a flow as a functor between theory models. It resolves"
357..436 Comment "// each imported member through the selected flow. It reads a renamed member as"
437..516 Comment "// the source member that the renaming names. A flow member that is the name of"
517..593 Comment "// a domain member alone binds the declaration of the source. Any other flow"
594..633 Comment "// member is the code of this importer."
634..636 Comment "//"
637..652 Comment "// - see: #3378"
653..668 Comment "// - see: #3461"
669..715 Comment "// - see: model/modules/translated-newer.gandr"
716..763 Comment "// - see: pathological/modules/translated.gandr"
